  "above_the_fold_copy": "Audio Jones — Applied Intelligence Systems Cancellation & Refund Policy Last Updated: October 29, 2025 1. Online Services Cancel ≥ 7 days before next billing cycle for no charge. Work in progress is billed prorata. 2. In-Studio Sessions Cancel ≥ 48 hours before appointment → full credit. Cancel No-shows → non-refundable. One reschedule complimentary within 30 days. 3. Deposits Non-refundable but transferable within 30 days. 4. Refund Processing Email contact@audiojones.com ; allow 5-10 business days. 5. Force Majeure Acts of God, power loss, or emergencies → credit or reschedule only. Governing Law: Florida. Ask Javi",
